scenario: Power on
id: arch2.power-on
kind: nominal
version: 1.0
status: in use
goal: The operator powers the drone on: the power-on part wakes Mission Configuration, which waits for a flight plan.
description: 2 - Patch, decentralized. The first scenario of the chain: it also says what is simulated and observed, for all the others.
author: MBSE Shepherd, Part 3
date: 2026-11-04
tags: part3, architecture 2
context: Logical SOI 2 - Patch Simulation
cut: Logical SOI 2 - Patch
settle: 2

system soi.mi "Manual Initialization" : Manual Initialization
system soi.mc "Mission Configuration" : Mission Configuration
system soi.bsrc "Base station link" : Base station remote communication
system soi.ap "AutoPilot" : AutoPilot
system soi.zs "Zone Surveillance" : Zone Surveillance
system soi.sm "SheepMonitoring" : SheepMonitoring
system soi.pm "Predator Management" : Predator Management
driver operator "Operator" : Operator
driver pasture "Pasture Environment" : Pasture Environment

phase Preparation

  step power: operator sends Start SOI
    note: The operator powers the drone on.
    then soi.mi is Powered On
    then soi.mc is Unconfigured
